  "cli_result_text": "Submitted the 15 files that make up Ceph RGW's S3 authentication implementation, in priority order:\n\n**Core signature verification (V2/V4 signing logic):**\n- `rgw_auth_s3.cc` / `.h` \u2014 canonical request construction, `is_time_skew_ok()`, `get_v4_signature()`, `get_v2_signature()`, AWS SigV4 chunked-upload completer\n\n**S3 REST layer & auth engines:**\n- `rgw_rest_s3.cc` / `.h` \u2014 `AWSGeneralAbstractor` (V2/V4 dispatch), `LocalEngine` (secret-key lookup + signature comparison), `S3AnonymousEngine`, `RGW_Auth_S3::authorize`\n\n**Auth framework (engine/strategy/applier abstractions):**\n- `rgw_auth.cc` / `.h` \u2014 `Strategy::authenticate`, engine chaining (REQUISITE/SUFFICIENT/FALLBACK), identity appliers\n- `rgw_auth_registry.h` \u2014 wires up the S3 main strategy (plain V4 \u2192 boto2/V2 fallback), STS, Swift\n- `rgw_auth_filters.h` \u2014 `SysReqApplier`, `ThirdPartyAccountApplier` decorators\n\n**Secret handling & request plumbing:**\n- `rgw_crypt_sanitize.h` \u2014 log redaction for secret-bearing fields\n- `rgw_rest.h` / `.cc` \u2014 header/env extraction feeding the canonical request\n- `rgw_common.h` / `.cc` \u2014 `RGWAccessKey` (secret key storage), request state\n\n**External auth (relevant to sig fallback/replay surface):**\n- `rgw_auth_keystone.h` / `.cc` \u2014 EC2Engine, SigV2-based Keystone auth path\n\nThis set covers all four audit angles: V2/V4 fallback (`rgw_rest_s3.h`'s `AWSAuthStrategy` FALLBACK control + `AWSGeneralBoto2Abstractor`), timestamp/replay window (`is_time_skew_ok` in `rgw_auth_s3.h/.cc`), signature comparison (`LocalEngine::authenticate` in `rgw_rest_s3.cc`), and secret key storage/logging (`rgw_common.h`, `rgw_crypt_sanitize.h`).",
